+* We will shift left until all leading set bits are shifted out of the value
+*
+* Exmaple 1, zero trailing bits:
+*   C Val   N
+*   - ----  -
+*   . 0001  4
+*   0 01..  2
+*   1 ....  0
+*
+* Exmaple 2, one trailing bit:
+*   C Val   N
+*   - ----  -
+*   . 0010  4
+*   0 10..  2
+*   0 ....  1
+*
+* Exmaple 3, two trailing bits:
+*   C Val   N
+*   - ----  -
+*   0 0100  4
+*   1 00..  2
+*/
