+/******************************************************************************
+*                               __divmodend
+*******************************************************************************
+* Common code for the end of all signed division and modulo calculations
+*
+* Inputs:  [R1,R2] - Positive 32-bit quotient
+*          [R3,R4] - Positive 32-bit denominator
+*          sp-2    - Return pointer
+*          sp-4    - Sign of result
+*          
+* Returns: [R1,R2] - Signed 32-bit result
